IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-YUL-6502-VIA6522.

DATA DIVISION.
01 CLOCK-CYCLES        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 VIA-PORTS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 IRQ-RATE            PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-6502-VIA.
    IF CLOCK-CYCLES == 0 OR VIA-PORTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 88400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 CLOCK-CYCLES.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
